Props read-only data hote hain jo parent component se child component mein pass kiye jate hain. 
Yeh components ko reusable banane mein madad karte hain taake hum ek hi component ko alag-alag data ke sath mukhtalif jagah use kar sakein

State component ka apna personal data hota hai jo waqt ke sath change ho sakta hai. Jab bhi state change hoti hai React khud-ba-khud uss screen (UI) ko update kar deta hai taake naya data user ko nazar aaye